{"seq":1,"slug":"annus-mirabilis-1905","title":"1905 奇迹之年：四篇改写物理学的论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/life-and-times/scientific-revolution-and-fame/annus-mirabilis-1905","wordCount":1756,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"1905-奇迹之年-四篇改写物理学的论文\">1905 奇迹之年：四篇改写物理学的论文</h1><p>1905 年，一位二十六岁、白天在伯尔尼专利局审查发明、没有大学职位也没有研究经费的年轻人，在短短数月内向德国权威期刊《物理年鉴》（Annalen der Physik）连续投出四篇论文。每一篇都足以单独载入物理学史，合在一起则彻底改写了人类对光、原子与时空的理解。后世称这一年为爱因斯坦的&quot;奇迹之年&quot;（annus mirabilis）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一年-四场革命\">核心概念：一年，四场革命</h2><p>这四篇论文涉及三个看似毫不相干的领域，却各自击中了当时物理学的根本难题。下图概括它们的主题与历史地位：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;1905 奇迹之年&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;3月·光电效应&lt;br/&gt;光量子假说&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;5月·布朗运动&lt;br/&gt;原子真实性证据&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;6月·狭义相对论&lt;br/&gt;时空革命&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;9月·质能关系&lt;br/&gt;E = mc²&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;量子论奠基&lt;br/&gt;1921 诺奖&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;统计力学胜利&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;颠覆绝对时空&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; I[&quot;核能理论根基&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"1905 奇迹之年\"] --&gt; B[\"3月·光电效应&lt;br/&gt;光量子假说\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"5月·布朗运动&lt;br/&gt;原子真实性证据\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"6月·狭义相对论&lt;br/&gt;时空革命\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"9月·质能关系&lt;br/&gt;E = mc²\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"量子论奠基&lt;br/&gt;1921 诺奖\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"统计力学胜利\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"颠覆绝对时空\"]\n    E --&gt; I[\"核能理论根基\"]</pre><p>下表列出四篇论文的核心贡献：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>提交时间</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心突破</th>\n<th>后续影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1905 年 3 月</td>\n<td>光电效应</td>\n<td>光由能量量子（光子）构成</td>\n<td>量子力学奠基，1921 年诺奖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1905 年 5 月</td>\n<td>布朗运动</td>\n<td>用分子热运动定量解释</td>\n<td>为原子真实存在提供决定性证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1905 年 6 月</td>\n<td>狭义相对论</td>\n<td>时间与空间随参照系而变</td>\n<td>颠覆牛顿绝对时空观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1905 年 9 月</td>\n<td>质能等价</td>\n<td>质量即能量的一种形式</td>\n<td>核物理与核能的理论基础</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得注意的共同点在于：这四篇论文解决问题的路径如出一辙——都从经典物理学内部无法回避的矛盾出发，用一个大胆而极简的新假设去化解它，再给出可被检验的定量预言。下表把每篇论文&quot;面对的困境&quot;与&quot;提出的解法&quot;并置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>论文</th>\n<th>经典物理的困境</th>\n<th>爱因斯坦的解法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光电效应</td>\n<td>连续波理论无法解释电子能量随频率而变</td>\n<td>假设光的能量以离散量子形式交换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布朗运动</td>\n<td>无法从微观证明分子的真实存在</td>\n<td>用统计力学推出可测量的位移公式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>狭义相对论</td>\n<td>光速在不同参照系下的表现自相矛盾</td>\n<td>把光速不变与相对性原理作为公设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质能等价</td>\n<td>质量与能量被视为彼此独立</td>\n<td>由相对论推出二者可相互转化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种&quot;从矛盾出发、以极简假设化解、用预言检验&quot;的模式，正是他日后方法论的雏形，也是四篇论文虽主题各异却能出自同一人之手的内在原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"光量子假说-他自称-最具革命性-的一篇\">光量子假说：他自称&quot;最具革命性&quot;的一篇</h2><p>第一篇论文《关于光的产生和转化的一个启发性观点》提出，光不仅是连续的波，在与物质相互作用时还表现为离散的能量包——后来被称为&quot;光子&quot;。爱因斯坦用这一假说成功解释了光电效应：金属在光照下释放电子的现象，其电子能量只取决于光的频率而非强度。</p>\n<p>这一观点在当时极为激进，因为它与麦克斯韦经典电磁理论中&quot;光是连续波&quot;的图景正面冲突。连普朗克这样的量子先驱起初也难以接受。爱因斯坦本人在写给好友哈比希特的信中，唯独称这篇论文是&quot;非常革命性的&quot;。光电效应的解释，正是十六年后他获得诺贝尔物理学奖的理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"布朗运动-让原子从假设变成事实\">布朗运动：让原子从假设变成事实</h2><p>第二篇论文针对布朗运动——悬浮在液体中的花粉微粒持续不规则抖动的现象。爱因斯坦用统计力学方法证明，这种抖动正是无数看不见的液体分子持续撞击微粒的统计结果，并给出了微粒位移与时间关系的定量公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle x^2 \\rangle = 2 D t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle x^2 \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 是微粒在一维方向上位移平方的平均值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为扩散系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为时间。这一可被实验检验的预言，几年后由法国物理学家让·佩兰（Jean Perrin）通过精密实验证实，从而为&quot;原子和分子真实存在&quot;这一在十九世纪末仍有争议的命题，提供了决定性证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"狭义相对论-时间不再是绝对的\">狭义相对论：时间不再是绝对的</h2><p>第三篇论文《论动体的电动力学》正式提出狭义相对论。爱因斯坦从两条简洁的公设出发：其一，物理定律在所有惯性参照系中形式相同（相对性原理）；其二，真空中光速对所有观察者都相同，与光源运动无关（光速不变原理）。</p>\n<p>由这两条公设，他推导出一系列颠覆直觉的结论：运动的时钟会变慢（时间膨胀），运动的物体在运动方向上会收缩（长度收缩），&quot;同时&quot;并非绝对而是依赖于参照系。运动物体的时间膨胀由洛伦兹因子描述：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - \\dfrac{v^2}{c^2}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6514em;vertical-align:-2.33em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6876em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6876em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6476em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7524em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.9176em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6876em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3646em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6876em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.33em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 是物体速度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是光速。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma \\approx 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，相对论效应可忽略，这解释了为何日常经验中我们从未察觉它。狭义相对论彻底废除了牛顿的绝对时间与绝对空间，把时间与空间编织成一个统一的整体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质能等价-e-mc-2-的诞生\">质能等价：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = mc^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的诞生</h2><p>同年 9 月，爱因斯坦发表了一篇简短的补充论文，从狭义相对论中推出一个惊人的推论：物体的质量是其能量的量度，二者可以相互转化。这个关系后来浓缩为科学史上最著名的方程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = mc^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是能量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是质量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是光速。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 极其巨大（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 米每秒），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 更是天文数字，这意味着极小的质量也蕴含着极其惊人的能量。这一关系在当时纯属理论推演，却在四十年后的核裂变、核武器与核电站中得到了最震撼、也最沉重的验证——这一关联将在后文关于原子弹的章节中再度浮现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>1905 年，爱因斯坦在数月内向《物理年鉴》投出四篇划时代论文，史称&quot;奇迹之年&quot;。</li>\n<li>光量子假说解释了光电效应，是量子论的奠基之作，也是他 1921 年诺奖的真正理由。</li>\n<li>布朗运动的统计解释给出了可检验的位移公式，为原子的真实存在提供了决定性证据。</li>\n<li>狭义相对论由相对性原理与光速不变原理出发，推出时间膨胀、长度收缩、同时性相对化，废除了绝对时空观。</li>\n<li>质能等价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = mc^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 揭示质量与能量可相互转化，成为后世核物理与核能的理论根基。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"1905 奇迹之年：四篇改写物理学的论文","id":"1905-奇迹之年-四篇改写物理学的论文"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一年，四场革命","id":"核心概念-一年-四场革命"},{"level":2,"text":"光量子假说：他自称\"最具革命性\"的一篇","id":"光量子假说-他自称-最具革命性-的一篇"},{"level":2,"text":"布朗运动：让原子从假设变成事实","id":"布朗运动-让原子从假设变成事实"},{"level":2,"text":"狭义相对论：时间不再是绝对的","id":"狭义相对论-时间不再是绝对的"},{"level":2,"text":"质能等价：E = mc^2 的诞生","id":"质能等价-e-mc-2-的诞生"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"苏黎世求学与伯尔尼专利局岁月","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/life-and-times/early-life-and-formation/zurich-polytechnic-and-patent-office"},"next":{"title":"广义相对论与 1919 年日食观测","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/life-and-times/scientific-revolution-and-fame/general-relativity-and-1919-eclipse"}}